  <item>
    <title>03 和S_王爷聊聊关于运动和美</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66ab26bc33ddcbb53c9209b2</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66ab26bc33ddcbb53c9209b2</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 01 Aug 2024 06:10:02 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>上个周末，和伙伴们在北京玩了几天。参加了一次LFRC周末例跑。深度感受了一下这个时尚先锋潮流跑团。</span></p><span></span><p><span>美是一种强有力的生产力。</span></p><span></span><p><span>我们追求更快更高更强，我们也追求更美。</span></p><span></span><p><span>王爷小红书：S_王爷</span></p><span></span><p><span>LFRC小红书：LAMFO</span></p><span></span><p><span>ZWYN训场地址：三里屯3.3大厦6楼（百度地图高德地图可搜到）</span></p><span></span><p><span>加入有成色跑者俱乐部：</span></p><span></span><p><span>每周二晚七点上东里中心广场集合。</span></p><span></span><p><span>每周四金融岛汇丰银行门前，七点十分集合，一起放肆跑。</span></p><span></span><p><span>欢迎全国跑友来郑州找我们，一起城市漫跑。</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fq5mWe5ERrehXMb1oaBVZg2GgdPc.jpeg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FibqPDfPvaEQ42JHtTTvC720xPQt.jpeg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgUuubtyLBxPzJEWr-yTqbCAqkuR.jpeg"></figure>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/llgkZwFdaCc4at3QrHsGhoVua88I.m4a" length="36614504" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:47:18</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkJ4EBQYR9KIXlme5t77dBg_d_dJ.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
